    "https://wichita-state-university-careers.career-pages.com/jobs/search?query=": {
      "title": "All Jobs Search Page",
      "description": "All Jobs Search Page social--blog Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Quick Links Close Menu Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal Why Wichita State University View\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll Jobs My Profile Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Academic Calendar Apply Now! A-Z Directory Blackboard Calendar of Events Office Hours Policies and Procedures Schedule of Courses Shocker Store Student Webmail Technology HelpDesk Transfer to WSU University Libraries Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal View All Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode Skip to jobs search results Clear Filters Category Search categories 12 filter options found Category Academic/Student Support (6 items) 6 Adjunct Faculty/Lecturer (5 items) 5 Athletics (4 items) 4 Aviation (37 items) 37 Facilities/Groundskeeping (1 items) 1 Finance (1 items) 1 Information Technology (3 items) 3 Management/Administration (6 items) 6 Office/Administrative Support (5 items) 5 Staff (71 items) 71 Student (95 items) 95 Temporary (32 items) 32 Department(s) Search 29 filter options found Department(s) Academic Affairs Departments (6 items) 6 Academic Affairs Direct (2 items) 2 Academic Programs (2 items) 2 Administrative and Support (4 items) 4 Barton School of Business (4 items) 4 Cohens Honors College (1 items) 1 College of Education (2 items) 2 College of Engineering (7 items) 7 College of Fine Arts (4 items) 4 College of Health Professions (3 items) 3 College of Liberal Arts & Sciences (7 items) 7 Culture and HR (2 items) 2 Finance Administration (College) (1 items) 1 FirePoint Innovations (1 items) 1 Information Technology (3 items) 3 Library (1 items) 1 Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm (22 items) 22 NIAR Institute (68 items) 68 Office Ind & Defense Administration (9 items) 9 Office of CivilRights,TitleIX & ADA (1 items) 1 Office of Research (College) (2 items) 2 Physical Plant (7 items) 7 Strategic Communications (1 items) 1 Strategic Engagement & Planning (22 items) 22 Strategic Enrollment (1 items) 1 Strategic Enrollment Mgmt (7 items) 7 Student Affairs (College) (6 items) 6 Women's Sports/Activities (2 items) 2 WSU Police Department (3 items) 3 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499517 Wichita Student College of Engineering A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Read more NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant 499661 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Full Scale Structural Test lab is looking for a Facilities Student Assistant. Read more NIAR Program Manager I - Sustainment 499590 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute NIAR Sustainment is seeking an experienced and highly motivated Program Manager to join our team in Park City, KS. In this role, you will lead and support cross‑functional project teams, ensuring the successful execution of laboratory research, testing, and program activities. This position offers the opportunity to work in a fast‑paced, hands‑on environment where collaboration, technical aptitude, and strong program oversight are key. If you’re driven to deliver results, excel at managing complex program requirements, and thrive in a team‑oriented setting, we invite you to apply. Read more Work Study Only- Student Assistant- Business Student Success Center 499562 Wichita Student Barton School of Business Looking for a flexible, on campus job to help develop your professional and customer service skills while working in a friendly and supportive environment? The Barton School of Business Student Success Center in Woolsey Hall is looking for a work study eligible student assistant to join our team to help staff our front desk to welcome guests, schedule student appointments, and assist with outreach to current and prospective students among other tasks.\n\nAll majors are invited to apply! Normal office hours are Monday through Friday from 8 AM to 5 PM but work schedules are flexible around your class schedule. Student workers can expect to be scheduled 10-20 hours per week on average. Must be federal work study eligible. Read more Senior Investigator- Civil Rights & Title IX 499501 Wichita Staff Office of CivilRights,TitleIX & ADA The Role: Objective Investigation & Policy Compliance\n\nWe are seeking a precise, analytical professional to join our team as a Civil Rights and Title IX Investigator. In this role, you will serve as a neutral fact-finder, managing complex cases and ensuring strict compliance with institutional policies and federal regulations. Read more Financial Aid Advisor 499474 Wichita Academic/Student Support Staff Strategic Enrollment Mgmt Are you ready to make a difference in the lives of students? We’re looking for an energetic, empathetic person to join our Student Impact Team -- someone who’s excited to help students navigate financial aid, scholarships, loans, and their overall financial wellness.\n\nIn this role, you’ll do more than process paperwork. You’ll meet with students and families, respond to cases and emails, and collaborate with partners across campus. You’ll listen closely, identify what students truly need, and help them understand the options available to them. Read more Maintenance Technician, Senior 499331 Wichita Staff Physical Plant As a Senior Maintenance Technician, you're one of the key people who helps keep everything running smoothly behind the scenes. Part organizer, part problem-solver, and part efficiency expert, you ensure materials, equipment, and supplies are where they need to be, when they need to be there. From managing inventory and tracking resources to organizing equipment and supporting workflow planning, you help create the structure that allows the entire operation to succeed.\n\nYou'll use powered industrial equipment to safely move materials throughout the facility, assist with the staging and tracking of assets and supplies, and maintain accurate records that help keep operations organized and efficient. When stock levels need attention or resources need to be coordinated, you're ready to step in and make sure nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nYour impact extends beyond materials and inventory. You help keep the facility safe, functional, and well-maintained through routine building maintenance, minor repairs, preventive maintenance activities, equipment inspections, and general upkeep of facility systems and infrastructure. Whether responding to service requests, addressing everyday maintenance needs, or supporting seasonal snow and ice removal efforts, you take pride in helping create an environment where people can do their best work.\n\nSuccess in this role comes from attention to detail, a commitment to safety, and a proactive approach to continuous improvement. You enjoy finding ways to make things more organized, efficient, and reliable, and you take pride in being a trusted team member who helps keep both operations and facilities running at their best. Read more IDP Project Coordinator - Advanced Materials Research 499643 Wichita Aviation Staff NIAR Institute Join the innovative team at NIAR’s Advanced Materials Research group and help drive cutting‑edge projects that shape the future of aerospace and advanced manufacturing. We’re looking for a proactive Project Manager who thrives in a collaborative, fast‑paced environment and enjoys turning complex ideas into successful, well‑executed outcomes. If you’re motivated by meaningful work, enjoy partnering with experts across disciplines, and want to be part of a mission-focused research organization, we’d love to hear from you. Read more Custodial Lead 499392 Wichita Staff Physical Plant Join a team that takes pride in maintaining a clean, safe, and welcoming environment for students, faculty, and staff.\n\nAs a Custodial Lead, you will play a vital role in the upkeep of our university facilities by performing specialized custodial services and ensuring the proper operation and maintenance of custodial equipment. And the best part? You’ll enjoy a robust benefits package effective on your first day, supporting your health, well-being, and future, because we believe in taking care of the people who take care of our campus. Read more Custodial Supervisor, Second Shift 499396 Wichita Staff Physical Plant Join a team that takes pride in maintaining a clean, safe, and welcoming environment for students, faculty, and staff.\n\nAs a Custodial Supervisor, you will play a vital role in the upkeep of our university facilities by performing specialized custodial services and ensuring the proper operation and maintenance of custodial equipment.\n\nAnd the best part? You’ll enjoy a robust benefits package effective on your first day, supporting your health, well-being, and future, because we believe in taking care of the people who take care of our campus. Read more Custodian Specialist, Senior 499389 Wichita Staff Physical Plant When campus floors need expert care and cleaning equipment needs a skilled hand, our Custodian Specialist, Senior steps in to make it happen.\n\nYou’re the kind of person who takes pride in a gleaming hallway, a freshly waxed floor, and a vacuum that hums like new. You know your way around scrubbers, buffers, and carpet extractors, and when something breaks, you don’t just report it, you help fix it. You research parts and coordinate repairs to keep our custodial equipment running like a dream. Read more Custodian, Special Events and Projects 499391 Wichita Staff Physical Plant The Custodian of Special Events and Projects plays a key role in keeping the WSU campus clean, disinfected, and safe while supporting the energetic flow of athletic, community, and special events that bring the university to life. This dynamic position adapts to shifting schedules, including weekends, evenings, and nontraditional hours, to ensure every event shines, from packed athletic games to campus wide celebrations. In addition to event support, this role also contributes to important campus projects such as floor refinishing, carpet extraction, deep restroom sanitization, and seasonal maintenance tasks that keep facilities in top condition. The position also champions environmentally conscious “green” cleaning practices, helping create healthier spaces for students, staff, and visitors. With a robust benefits package effective on day one, generous paid time off, and the opportunity to directly support WSU’s most memorable moments, this role offers both meaningful impact and rewarding flexibility. Read more Environmental Health and Safety Compliance Specialist, Senior 499394 Wichita Staff Physical Plant We are excited to announce an opportunity for a Senior Environmental Health and Safety Compliance Specialist to join our university community and play a vital role in fostering a safe, healthy, and compliant campus environment. This position coordinates with various areas to complete assigned environmental health and safety functions and inspections. Provides guidance and assistance and is responsible for promoting a safe and healthy workplace. Implements plans based on contracts, regulations, applicable laws and audit/inspection results to ensure that compliance is maintained. May provide training to employees in areas including, but not limited to, environmental, health and safety management best practices, and assisting with hazard identification and control. Read more ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant - Back Office 499611 Wichita Student Information Technology ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant: Telecommunications is part of WSU’s Information Technology Services. We provide and support telephone and network connectivity for all WSU locations. This is a regular student position. Students of all majors are encouraged to apply. Read more NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R 499572 Wichita Student Information Technology ITS Telecommunications Student Administrative Assistant: Telecommunications is part of WSU’s Information Technology Services. We provide and support telephone and network connectivity for all WSU locations. This is a regular student position. Students of all majors are encouraged to apply. Read more Boeing IT Assistant 496377 Wichita Temporary Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student to work at Boeing AeroSystems as an IT student assistant. Read more Boeing IT Student Assistant 496376 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Ennovar is looking for a student to work at Boeing AeroSystems as an IT student assistant Read more NIAR DARC Electrical Design Student Assistant 497770 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The Engineering Design and Mod Team is seeking a student assistant to assist with electrical design. Read more NIAR DARC Design Student Assistant 496792 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The Engineering Design and Mod team is looking for a student assistant to help with daily tasks. Read more NIAR IT Student Assistant 495589 Wichita Student Office Ind & Defense Administration The Information Technology Center is looking for an IT student assistant to help with daily tasks such as software and hardware installs, phone support as well as onsite, troubleshooting, and documentation. Read more DRTH Embedded Security Student Assistant 499405 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm The Embedded Security Student Assistant will work directly with the research development team to support the design and implementation of security assessments for embedded devices. This role offers hands-on experience with AI-assisted penetration testing, reverse engineering, and standardized security frameworks. The ideal candidate will contribute to finding vulnerabilities and developing proof-of-concept exploits while learning standardized frameworks and low-level functionality of embedded systems. Read more AI Developer Student Assistant - Digital Research and Transformation Hub 498475 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm The AI Developer Student Assistant will work directly with the research development team to support the design, development, and deployment of AI/ML applications and infrastructure. This role offers hands-on experience with modern AI technologies including Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems, cloud infrastructure, and containerized applications. The ideal candidate will contribute to real production systems while learning industry best practices in AI development, DevOps, and cybersecurity. Read more Full Scale Business Student Assistant 497809 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Full Scale Structural Test lab is looking for a business student assistant to assist with project management. Read more NIAR ATLAS Testing Student Assistant 497160 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ATLAS lab is looking for a student assistant to help with testing and data analysis. Read more NIAR Sustainment Student Assistant 495673 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR Sustainment Lab is looking for a student to help with different aspects of their lab help including parts labeling, parts identification, and cataloging parts. Read more DRTH Human Factors in Cybersecurity Student Assistant 499404 Wichita Student Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm The Human Factors in Cybersecurity Student Assistant will work directly with the research development team to support the design and implementation of human subject experiments. This role offers hands-on experience with designing and implementing web interfaces, designing surveys, and analyzing data. The ideal candidate will contribute to the design and execution of experiments with human subjects. Read more NIAR Composites Fabrication Student Assistant 499199 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The Composites Lab at Wichita State University is looking for a Student assistant to join our Composite Fabrication team. This position provides hands-on experience in manufacturing advanced composite structures used in aerospace research and development. The ideal candidate enjoys working with their hands, following detailed processes, and contributing to a collaborative research environment. Read more NIAR APEX Engineering Student Assistant 499043 Wichita Student NIAR Institute NIAR’s APEX lab is looking for students to work with multiple lab capabilities for various projects at HAMR. Students may be required to learn about CAD and other software products and hardware. They will support a variety of projects and programs for the lab. Their task may range from classroom support and project research to direct industry program support. Employees will be expected to assist lab staff in any way possible to help make the lab successful, presentable to customers, and accomplish projects in a timely manner. Read more Advanced Materials Research Student Assistant 498639 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The Advanced Materials Research group is looking for an engineering (or related field) student with interest in additive manufacturing (metallic and polymer), high-temperature composite materials, or software development and databasing to join their team. This position will focus on supporting all aspects of applied research for various government and industry customers. Projects are focused on characterization and qualification of these materials and processes, as well as integration into cutting-edge applications. This position will be based in Wichita, KS and will see you work closely with engineers at NIAR to support our growing government and industry customer base. If you are detail oriented, enjoy challenging and rewarding work, and like being part of a team, consider applying for this position. Read more NIAR ETL Student Engineering Assistant 497161 Wichita Student NIAR Institute The NIAR ETL is looking for a student assistant to help with testing aircraft components. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 201 in total ‹ 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 › 1845 Fairmount St. Wichita , Kansas 67260 USA (316) 978-3456 Request Info Visit Apply Contact Us Virtual Tour Campus Map and Directions Facebook X | Twitter Instagram YouTube Linkedin People at Wichita State will make introductions, look for (applied learning) opportunities, and give advice that will put you miles ahead of others. Jon Peterson , senior in business administration and real estate finance Alumni & Friends Give to WSU A-Z Index Freedom of Expression Policies and Procedures Privacy Policy Notice of Nondiscrimination Title IX Campus Safety Accessibility Public Information Website Support KBOR Freedom of Expression Statement HLC Accreditation © 2024 Wichita State University Wichita State University (\"WSU\") does not discriminate on the basis of sex in its education programs, activities, admissions and employment. Candidate Details We use \"cookies\" on this site. A cookie is a piece of data stored on a site visitor's hard drive to help us improve your access to our site and identify repeat visitors to our site. For instance, when we use a cookie to identify you, you would not have to log in a password more than once, thereby saving time while on our site. Cookies can also enable us to track and target the interests of our users to enhance the experience on our site. Usage of a cookie is in no way linked to any personally identifiable information on our site. Some of our business partners may use cookies on our site (for example, Google Analytics). However, we have no access to or control over these cookies. I do not accept I accept"
