    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/its-telecommunications-student-assistant-back-office-wichita-kansas-united-states-931b21bf-1b8e-462c-ad17-ce8afed374ef": {
      "title": "ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant",
      "description": "ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant - Back Office - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Quick Links Close Menu Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal Why Wichita State University View\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll Jobs My Profile Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Academic Calendar Apply Now! A-Z Directory Blackboard Calendar of Events Office Hours Policies and Procedures Schedule of Courses Shocker Store Student Webmail Technology HelpDesk Transfer to WSU University Libraries Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal View All Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant - Back Office Information Technology | Student ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant - Back Office 499611 Student Add to favorites View favorites Department Information Technology Services - Telecommunications Campus Location Wichita, KS - WSU Main Campus Hire Type Part Time Pay From $11 to $12 per hour, dependent on experience. Work Schedule ; work is performed on-site and in person. Dependent on Class Schedule, during Office hours of Mon-Fri, 8AM-5PM Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story ITS Telecommunications Student Assistant: Telecommunications is part of WSU’s Information Technology Services. We provide and support telephone and network connectivity for all WSU locations. This is a regular student position. Students of all majors are encouraged to apply. Job Summary A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. Job Duties Duties will vary but include the following: · Data collection/connection audits. · Connection updates. · Materials receiving, sorting and inventory. · Telephone testing. · Office tasks such as recycling, cleaning, filing, and running errands. · Assist technicians with work orders Required Education High School diploma or equivalent. Enrolled in a minimum of 6 credit hours at Wichita State University. Additional Requirements Required skills: · Familiarity with Microsoft office suite. · Experience working with a team and independently. We need a time commitment of at least 20 hours a week during our normal business hours, weekdays 8am to 5pm. Required Experience This is specific to each position and department. See additional requirements and preferences. Preferred Qualifications This is an entry-level position, however, preference given to applicants that can demonstrate previous experience in the following areas: · Previous technical work experience (not limited to IT fields). · Customer service experience. · Experience reading blue prints. · Experience with Microsoft Visio. · Experience using hand tools. Additional Information Former students in this position that have demonstrated technical and organizational abilities have developed into student technicians. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment including but not limited to phone, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 8b478a63 Last Name (required) 3c8bdc98 Email (required) 74b36a25 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking th