fications Majoring in Business or other related filed of study. Additional Information for Posting Work is 100% on-site at the NIAR ASTEC facility in Park City, KS. Physical Requirements Ability to remain in a stationary position. Ability to operate a computer and other office equipment, including but not limited to phones, printers, copiers, and calculators. Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) e4b2a89a Last Name (required) ebb4c7e4 Email (required) 475b537a Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 49015fff Last Name (required) 43a1e085 Email (required) 2d59b619 Job Alert a081650b Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Student Student Department(s) NIAR Institute NIAR Institute Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) e6533502 Last Name (required) cdc9a593 Email (required) 73eb8b94 Send This Job To: cc22efbb Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you c