    "https://jobs.wichita.edu/jobs/jaks-construction-coordinator-wichita-kansas-united-states": {
      "title": "JAKS Construction Coordinator",
      "description": "JAKS Construction Coordinator - Wichita, Kansas, United States social--blog Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Quick Links Close Menu Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal Why Wichita State University View\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAll Jobs My Profile Leadership Innovation at WSU Research Directories Give to WSU myWSU OneStop Academic Calendar Apply Now! A-Z Directory Blackboard Calendar of Events Office Hours Policies and Procedures Schedule of Courses Shocker Store Student Webmail Technology HelpDesk Transfer to WSU University Libraries Close Menu Careers Faculty Staff Internal View All Jobs My Profile Kiosk mode JAKS Construction Coordinator Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm | Temporary JAKS Construction Coordinator 499286 Temporary Add to favorites View favorites Department Ennovar Campus Location Wichita, KS - Other Wichita Location Hire Type Part Time Pay $15 - 18 per hour Work Schedule Flexible Export Compliance Requirement This position requires access to EAR or ITAR controlled technologies. Applicants are required to be eligible for employment under U.S. export control laws and must meet the requirement of being a “U.S. Citizen”. Job Story Ennovar is looking for a Coordinator to work at JAKS Construction. Job Duties * Assist with creating and maintaining project schedules, task lists, and documentation in JobTread. * Coordinate with subcontractors and suppliers regarding project timelines, deliveries, quotes, and required documents. * Participate in site visits and inspections and help maintain daily logs, project photos, and progress updates. * Support the completion of punch lists, closeout documents, and client communications. * Assist with quantity takeoffs using project plans and specifications. * Request, collect, and organize subcontractor and supplier pricing. * Help prepare project estimates and maintain current material pricing information. * Assist with developing scopes of work, proposals, and presentation materials. * Support lead intake, follow-up, and organization of the sales pipeline. * Attend networking and community events with team members. * Help collect client reviews, referrals, and testimonials. Preferred Qualifications * Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in Construction Management, Engineering, Business, or a related field; equivalent hands-on experience or interest in the trades may be considered. * Strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and ability to follow through on assigned tasks. * Ability and willingness to learn new software, including JobTread, spreadsheets, and email platforms. * Strong written and verbal communication skills. * Reliable, self-motivated, coach-able, and able to work both independently and collaboratively. * Valid driver’s license and reliable transportation required for travel to customer and project sites. * Ability to work on active job sites, including walking, standing, occasional lifting, and exposure to varying weather conditions. Additional Information Work is performed on site at JAKS Construction 5025 E Kellogg Dr. Wichita, KS. Physical Requirements Ability to communicate with others and accurately exchange information. Apply Now First Name (required) 98bb7401 Last Name (required) 41aac658 Email (required) 1ccdca4f Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Sign Up for Job Alerts! First Name (required) 62a17eb1 Last Name (required) 1ec46f99 Email (required) 2a7c323f Job Alert d8d89055 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Temporary Temporary Department(s) Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Natl Inst for Rsrch&Digtal Transfrm Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy Thank you Share This Job With Someone Else! First Name (required) c705ed68 Last Name (required) 71a7efe2 Email (required) ba26a5c5 Send This Job To: 7554abdb Share Now! Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form and including your phone number, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Wichita State University.  Message & data rates may apply.  Message frequency varies.  Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). Privacy Policy We've sent this job to the email provided! Not the right fit? Search all jobs here. Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Recommended Jobs NBE Student Assistant WSU 0350R A student assistant will carry out administrative and technical tasks requested by a supervisor. Depending on the area the student assistant is employed in, they may assist and mentor other students or provide support throughout the campus in various forms. NIAR Full Scale Facilities Student Assistant The NIAR Full Scale Structural Test lab is looking for a Facilities Student Assistant. NIAR Program Manager I - Sustainment NIAR Sustainment is seeking an experienced and highly motivated Program Manager to join our team in Park City, KS. In this role, you will lead and support cross‑functional project teams, ensuring the successful execution of laboratory